      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.02,
          "end": 4.76,
          "en": "Now adding a loading state is nice,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.76,
          "end": 7.41,
          "en": "but things can also go wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.41,
          "end": 8.92,
          "en": "To simulate this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.92,
          "end": 11.323,
          "en": "we could, for example, add a typo in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.46,
          "end": 13.93,
          "en": "Of course, that is an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.93,
          "end": 16,
          "en": "we typically would fix as a developer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16,
          "end": 19.81,
          "en": "but I can do this to simulate that sending a request fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.81,
          "end": 23.58,
          "en": "It could fail because of internet connectivity,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.58,
          "end": 26.44,
          "en": "because of a problem with fire base itself",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.44,
          "end": 28.86,
          "en": "or a couple of other reasons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.86,
          "end": 33.11,
          "en": "Therefore, I deleted the dot here to make this URL invalid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.11,
          "end": 36.12,
          "en": "And if I do that, and if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.12,
          "end": 36.953,
          "en": "you will notice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.953,
          "end": 40.36,
          "en": "that now we have this loading spinner forever,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.36,
          "end": 43.98,
          "en": "because, well, fetching the data fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.98,
          "end": 46.35,
          "en": "I also get a warning that we have an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.35,
          "end": 49.11,
          "en": "a promise rejection, which wasn't handled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.11,
          "end": 51.88,
          "en": "And indeed, that is exactly what I wanna do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.88,
          "end": 54.32,
          "en": "We should handle this promise rejection,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.32,
          "end": 58.19,
          "en": "and we should show more meaningful feedback to the usser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.19,
          "end": 59.773,
          "en": "when things go wrong.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.86,
          "end": 62.39,
          "en": "And to achieve this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 62.39,
          "end": 65.92,
          "en": "we can add another overlay as a first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.92,
          "end": 68.95,
          "en": "We could name this ErrorOverlay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.95,
          "end": 70.88,
          "en": "And of course, using these overlays",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.88,
          "end": 74.05,
          "en": "is just one way of giving the users some feedback.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.05,
          "end": 77.78999999999999,
          "en": "You can manipulate the UI in whichever way you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.78999999999999,
          "end": 80.21000000000001,
          "en": "This is just an example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
