        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 231.29,
          "end": 234.62,
          "en": "So now we got this ErrorOverlay, which we can use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 234.62,
          "end": 237,
          "en": "and we can now use it in the places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 237,
          "end": 241.35,
          "en": "where things can go wrong like in recent expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 241.35,
          "end": 244.4,
          "en": "But how can we use this overlay there now?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 244.4,
          "end": 248.053,
          "en": "Well, just as we use the LoadingOverlay in the end.",
