        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 330.9,
          "end": 333.04,
          "en": "if I fetched them successfully.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 333.04,
          "end": 336.36,
          "en": "So that code where we set expenses in the context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 336.36,
          "end": 338.08299999999997,
          "en": "should go into the try block.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 339.04,
          "end": 341.32,
          "en": "But now with that we can use the error state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
